v 3
d rd2dnet: Boundary discontinuity designs on street networks
d
d Estimation and inference for boundary discontinuity designs on street
d networks. Extends the location-based framework of rd2d (Cattaneo, Titiunik
d and Yu) from Euclidean coordinates to network coordinates (signed network
d distance to the boundary and offset along it) and user-defined network
d distances (edge costs, travel time, road-class transition penalties).
d Side-specific local polynomial estimates of boundary average treatment
d effect curves with robust bias-corrected inference, uniform confidence
d bands, weighted and largest aggregate effects, fuzzy designs, covariates,
d derivative targets, HC, cluster and network Conley standard errors, a port
d of rd2d's bandwidth selector, and a network-normalised density test
d following rddensity (Cattaneo, Jansson and Ma).
d
d Please cite the rd2d papers when using this package (see help rd2dnet).
d
d KW: regression discontinuity
d KW: boundary discontinuity
d KW: rd2d
d KW: spatial
d KW: networks
d KW: causal inference
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261027
d
d Author: Zach Winship
d Support: email zachtwinship@gmail.com
d
